  ### Create new employee as HR
POST {{host}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{hrToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Khaled Mansour",
  "email": "khaled.mansour@test.com",
  "password": "Test@123",
  "role": "Employee",
  "departmentId": 1,
  "managerId": 2
}

### Get all users as HR
GET {{host}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{hrToken}}



### Update Khaled as HR
PUT {{host}}/api/users/14
Authorization: Bearer {{hrToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Khaled Ahmad Mansour",
  "email": "khaled.mansour@test.com",
  "role": "Employee",
  "departmentId": 1,
  "managerId": 2,
  "isActive": true
}

  ### Deactivate Khaled
DELETE {{host}}/api/users/14
Authorization: Bearer {{hrToken}}


  ### Login with deactivated account
